[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m 1. Let \(z = 4e^{i\theta} = 4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)\). Then, we can substitute \(z\) into the expression:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m    (75 + 117i)z + \frac{96 + 144i}{z} = (75 + 117i)4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta) + \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m    Simplifying the second term:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m    \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)} = \frac{96 + 144i}{4} \cdot \frac{1}{\cos\theta + i\sin\theta} = 24 + 36i \cdot (\cos\theta - i\sin\theta) = 24\cos\theta + 36\sin\theta + i(36\cos\theta - 24\sin\theta)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m    So the expression becomes:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m    (75 + 117i)4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta) + 24\cos\theta + 36\sin\theta + i(36\cos\theta - 24\sin\theta)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m    Expanding the first term:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m    (75 + 117i)4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta) = 300\cos\theta + 468i\cos\theta + 300i\sin\theta - 468\sin\theta = 300\cos\theta - 468\sin\theta + i(468\cos\theta + 300\sin\theta)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m    Adding the two terms together:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m    300\cos\theta - 468\sin\theta + 24\cos\theta + 36\sin\theta + i(468\cos\theta + 300\sin\theta + 36\cos\theta - 24\sin\theta) = 324\cos\theta - 432\sin\theta + i(504\cos\theta + 276\sin\theta)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m    The real part of the expression is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m    \[
