[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m    To find the maximum value of this expression, we can use the fact that \(a\cos\theta - b\sin\theta\) has a maximum value of \(\sqrt{a^2 + b^2}\). Here, \(a = 324\) and \(b = 432\), so the maximum value is:
