[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m The real part of the expression is \(324\cos\theta - 432\sin\theta\). To find the maximum value of this expression, we can use the fact that the maximum value of \(a\cos\theta + b\sin\theta\) is \(\sqrt{a^2 + b^2}\). Here, \(a = 324\) and \(b = -432\), so the maximum value is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m \sqrt{324^2 + (-432)^2} = \sqrt{324^2 + 432^2} = \sqrt{104976 + 186624} = \sqrt{291600} = 540
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m \]
