[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m [response] To solve the problem, we need to find the largest possible real part of the expression \((75 + 117i)z + \frac{96 + 144i}{z}\) where \(z\) is a complex number with \(|z| = 4\).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m Let's represent \(z\) in polar form as \(z = 4e^{i\theta}\), where \(\theta\) is a real number. Then we can rewrite the expression as follows:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m (75 + 117i)z + \frac{96 + 144i}{z} = (75 + 117i)4e^{i\theta} + \frac{96 + 144i}{4e^{i\theta}}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m Simplifying the second term, we get:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m \frac{96 + 144i}{4e^{i\theta}} = \frac{96 + 144i}{4}e^{-i\theta} = 24e^{-i\theta} + 36ie^{-i\theta} = 24(\cos(-\theta) + i\sin(-\theta)) + 36i(\cos(-\theta) + i\sin(-\theta))
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m = 24(\cos\theta - i\sin\theta) + 36i(\cos\theta - i\sin\theta) = 24\cos\theta - 24i\sin\theta + 36i\cos\theta + 36\sin\theta
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m = (24\cos\theta + 36\sin\theta) + i(36\cos\theta - 24\sin\theta)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m So the expression becomes:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m (75 + 117i)4e^{i\theta} + (24\cos\theta + 36\sin\theta) + i(36\cos\theta - 24\sin\theta)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m = (75 + 117i)4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta) + (24\cos\theta + 36\sin\theta) + i(36\cos\theta - 24\sin\theta)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m = (75 + 117i)4\cos\theta + (75 + 117i)4i\sin\theta + 24\cos\theta + 36\sin\theta + i(36\cos\theta - 24\sin\theta)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m = 300\cos\theta + 468i\cos\theta + 360i\sin\theta - 468\sin\theta + 24\cos\theta + 36\sin\theta + i(36\cos\theta - 24\sin\theta)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=67616)[0m Combining the real and imaginary parts, we get:
